                                                    <div class="card-title m-0 fs-2 clamp-2" role="heading" aria-level="3">
        <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260511akbons" class="stretched-link item-link">Stingers&rsquo; Season Ends in Heartbreaker Against Harford, Finish Year 50&ndash;13 with Third Straight Region 10 Title</a>
    </div>
                                                            <p class="card-text m-0 clamp-2">Florence-Darlington Technical College&rsquo;s season came to a close Saturday afternoon with a hard-fought 13&ndash;12 loss to Harford Community College at Lexington County Baseball Stadium.</p>
                                                            <div class="related-links position-relative mt-1">
                    <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260511akbons" class="me-2" aria-label="Baseball true event: May 9 01:00 PM: Harford Community College vs. Florence-Darlington Technical College: @ Lexington County Baseball Stadium: Recap" >Recap</a>
