            </div>
                                                    <div class="card-title m-0 fs-2 clamp-2" role="heading" aria-level="3">
        <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260511aaxqyz" class="stretched-link item-link">Stingers Force Game Three in East District Championship</a>
    </div>
                                                            <p class="card-text m-0 clamp-2">Elijah Sanders delivered seven scoreless innings as Florence-Darlington Technical College evened the series with a 7&ndash;4 victory over Harford Community College at Dailey Field.</p>
                                                            <div class="related-links position-relative mt-1">
                    <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260511aaxqyz" class="me-2" aria-label="Baseball true event: May 8 03:00 PM: Florence-Darlington Technical College at Harford Community College: Recap" >Recap</a>
