                    <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/photos/0011/index" class="me-2" aria-label="Baseball true event: May 4 02:30 PM: Florence-Darlington Technical College vs. Gaston College: @ Lexington County Baseball Stadium: Photos" >Photos</a>
