    </div>
                                                            <p class="card-text m-0 clamp-2">Tristan Strickland and Pat Costin each hit solo home runs, but Florence-Darlington Technical College fell to Gaston College, 16&ndash;2, in the Region 10 Championship game on Monday.</p>
